Z||000000||Tabs||11-04-2001||08:07 AM|||| Here in the GTA we've all seen thoses little imports with big "pure imports" decals all over them. Well I went to racetech a few weeks back and notice on their front dest was a bunch of domestic-disturbance cards. So I picked one up and when I got home I checked out their website and it's kinda like pure imports.com but for domestic cars.<P>By looking at the web page you can tell that whoever  came up with this just was really starting out and really has no members yet, But on the plus side theres a fiero on the home page along side a sunfire and also theres a fiero as it's disturbance of the month (car of the month). so I guess the fiero is getting a good showing with D-D<P>If anybody wants to check it out the address is <A HREF="http://www.domestic-disturbance.com" TARGET=_blank>www.domestic-disturbance.com</A> <BR> ||||reg||1
